1
00:00:01,309 --> 00:00:03,329
[ceol]

2
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:19,705
Oíche nua sa siopa caife,

3
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:19,705
Leagann ceo tiubh tithe. [ceol]

4
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:26,200
Fánaím trí na comharsanachtaí ina bhfuil na cuimhní cinn

5
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:26,200
cuir ar mire mé.

6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:32,095
Cá háit san earrach te

7
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:33,320
Clúdaíonn an geimhreadh an anam.

8
00:00:32,095 --> 00:00:36,760
[ceol]

9
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:38,645
Áit ar eitil an saol cosúil le saighead thar dhátaí, thar am atá thart

10
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,160
sinn.

11
00:00:38,645 --> 00:00:43,080
[ceol]

12
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:45,520
Bhailigh muid páipéir, ag dearmad cén fáth

13
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:45,520
maireann muid.

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:52,200
Agus ba chosúil i gcónaí, [ceol]

15
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:52,200
Tá fuaim C fós romhainn.

16
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,560
[ceol]

17
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:58,520
Am ar iasacht amháin

18
00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:58,520
ní thugann sé tada.

19
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:04,440
Agus go tobann titeann [ceol] ar mo chroí

20
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:08,960
oighear fuar.

21
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:12,200
Foghlaimímid meas a bheith againn ar an gceol nuair a chaillimid,

22
00:01:08,960 --> 00:01:14,670
nuair a théann solas duine éigin amach taobh thiar den doras.

23
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,240
Croithimid i ndiaidh na dtraenacha atá ag imeacht, ag iarraidh

24
00:01:14,670 --> 00:01:18,320
[ceol]

25
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:21,920
impigh ar an am atá thart le haghaidh freagra.

26
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:25,000
Foghlaimímid grá a thabhairt nuair a bhíonn sé fuar, [ceol]

27
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,360
nuair a bhíonn luaithreach i do bhois, ní cruach. FAOI,

28
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:30,000
dá mbeadh a fhios agam roimh ré, [ceol]

29
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:31,840
conas a ghoillfidh an ceann trédhearcach seo san anam

30
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:34,320
brón.

31
00:01:31,840 --> 00:01:37,840
Níor dhúirt sé, [ceol] nár thug sé barróg, ní raibh am aige.

32
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:41,120
Is cúis shíoraí é seo.

33
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:43,545
Shábháil mé gach rud don am atá le teacht, níl mo chroí do dhaoine eile

34
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,545
oscailte. [ceol]

35
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,520
Táimid ag troid leis an scáth,

36
00:01:46,111 --> 00:01:50,480
[ceol]

37
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:53,316
Dóimid amach thar rudaí beaga folamha.

38
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:53,880
Agus ní fheiceann tú conas atá an sioc ag socrú síos

39
00:01:53,316 --> 00:01:56,960
[ceol]

40
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:59,211
ar ár nguaillí.

41
00:01:56,960 --> 00:02:01,800
Ach ní i nglioscar fuinneoige siopa atá an sonas,

42
00:01:59,211 --> 00:02:05,040
[ceol] ní i mbabhta nótaí, ach i gciúin

43
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:06,880
fírinne na ngaolta, ina dteas i measc na stoirmeacha. Ach

44
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:09,920
ní thuigimid ach an rud atá [ceol] ann cheana féin

45
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:12,600
dodhéanta a thabhairt ar ais.

46
00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:15,760
Ag leanúint ar aghaidh le mo chuid ama fada

47
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:20,280
agus is minic gur cosán gan bhrí é [an ceol],

48
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:23,480
foghlaimímid meas a bheith againn nuair a chaillimid [ceol],

49
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:25,880
nuair a théann solas duine éigin amach taobh thiar den doras.

50
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:29,520
Croithimid i ndiaidh [ceol] na dtraenacha atá imithe,

51
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:33,160
ag iarraidh freagra a iarraidh ar an am atá thart.

52
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:35,000
Foghlaimímid grá a thabhairt do [cheol] nuair a bhíonn sé fuaraithe,

53
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:36,160
nuair a bhíonn luaithreach sna bosa, [ceol] agus ní

54
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,200
cruach. FAOI,

55
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:43,040
Dá mbeadh a fhios agam roimh ré conas a dhéanfadh sé gearán

56
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:45,061
an brón trédhearcach seo san anam.

57
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:45,480
Glaoigh ar na seanóirí, tabhair barróg dóibh,

58
00:02:45,061 --> 00:02:49,000
[ceol]

59
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:49,000
agus an cuisle ag bualadh.

60
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:54,231
Lig do na gearáin imeacht, táim ar son seo inniu.

61
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:55,080
Guím.

62
00:02:54,231 --> 00:02:58,280
[ceol]

63
00:02:55,080 --> 00:03:00,127
Mar go bhfuil deireadh le gach amhrán

64
00:02:58,280 --> 00:03:01,320
sa deireadh, ceann amháin.

65
00:03:00,127 --> 00:03:04,680
[ag canadh]

66
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:06,022
Fanann muid [ceol] i gcuimhne ar chlocha míle,

67
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,280
suímid dearmadta.

68
00:03:06,022 --> 00:03:11,760
[ceol]

69
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:13,720
Foghlaimímid meas a bheith againn nuair a chaillimid,

70
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:14,959
nuair a théann ceol duine amach taobh thiar den doras

71
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:17,959
solas.

72
00:03:14,959 --> 00:03:20,959
Croithimid i ndiaidh na dtraenacha atá ag imeacht, ag iarraidh

73
00:03:17,959 --> 00:03:22,360
impigh ar an am atá thart le haghaidh freagra.

74
00:03:20,959 --> 00:03:25,800
Foghlaimímid grá a thabhairt, [ceol]

75
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:28,080
nuair a fhuaraigh sé, nuair a bhí luaithreach sna pailme agus

76
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:31,160
criostal briste [ceoil]. Ba chóir dom aire a thabhairt dó

77
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:33,532
cad é, fad atáimid anseo, go dtí

78
00:03:31,160 --> 00:03:33,560
d'eitil ar shiúl

79
00:03:33,532 --> 00:03:36,720
[ceol]

80
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:36,720
anam i gcéin.

81
00:03:40,082 --> 00:03:42,102
[ceol]
